<title>USA: Strouds Nov same-store sales down 2.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Strouds Nov same-store sales down 2.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CITY OF INDUSTRY, Calif. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$19.7	$16.7	 n/a	 -2.4</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $150.9     $134.5	 n/a	 +1.3</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Month is 4 weeks ended November 30.</p>
<p>Full company name is Strouds Inc.</p>
<p>November 1995 sales figure is based on 7 more days than November 1996. Excluding those days, November 1996 same-store sales rose 1.4 pct from November 1995.</p>
</text>
